%%label III. Très lent
%%note B flat major. A long melody for the flute over a slow, waltz-like accompaniment of harp and strings; a warmer middle for the violins; the melody returns with celesta.
X:1
T:Ravel’s Missing Symphony
T:III. Très lent
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Maurice Ravel
M:3/4
L:1/8
Q:"Très lent" 1/4=54
%%score [fl ob eh cl bn] [hn] harp cel [v1 v2 va vc cb]
